item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.1=A modified undefined state of spacetime
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.2=used to aid in inter-gluon fusion and
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.3=spacetime annihilation. Yes, this destroys
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.4=the universe itself, slowly but steadily,
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.5=but at least you can power your toaster with
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.6=this, so it's all good.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.7=A cloud of billions of nano-wormholes which
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.8=deliberately fail at tunneling matter from
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.9=another dimension, rather it converts all
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.10=that matter into pure energy. That means
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.11=you're actively contributing to the destruction
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.12=of another dimension, sucking it dry like a
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.13=juicebox.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.14=That dimension probably sucked, anyways. I
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.15=bet it was full of wasps or some crap, man,
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.16=I hate these things.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.17=A star collapsing in on itself, mere nanoseconds
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.18=away from being turned into a black hole,
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.19=frozen in time. If I didn't know better I
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.20=would say this is some deep space magic
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.21=bullcrap some guy made up to sound intellectual.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.22=Probably Steve from accounting. You still owe me
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.23=ten bucks.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.24=Yeah I'm not even gonna question that one.
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.25=...am I even holding this right?
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.26=It's a small metal thing. I dunno where it's from
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.27=or what it does, maybe they found it on a
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.28=junkyard and sold it as some kind of antique
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.29=artifact. If it weren't for the fact that I can
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.30=actually stuff this into some great big laser
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.31=reactor thing, I'd probably bring it back to where
item.tooltip.item_a_m_s_core.32=it belongs. In the trash.
