item.tooltip.item_drop.3=Very heavy antimatter cluster.
item.tooltip.item_drop.4=Gets rid of black holes.
item.tooltip.item_drop.5=create a fólkvangr field!
item.tooltip.item_drop.6=You may be asking:
item.tooltip.item_drop.7="But HBM, a manifold with an undefined
item.tooltip.item_drop.8=state of spacetime? How is this possible?"
item.tooltip.item_drop.9=Long answer short:
item.tooltip.item_drop.10="I have no idea!"
item.tooltip.item_drop.11=Nullifies resonance of objects in
item.tooltip.item_drop.12=non-euclidean space, creates variable
item.tooltip.item_drop.13=gravity well. Spontaneously spawns
item.tooltip.item_drop.14=tesseracts. If a tesseract happens to
item.tooltip.item_drop.15=appear near you, do not look directly
item.tooltip.item_drop.16=at it.
item.tooltip.item_drop.17=Continuously heats up matter by
item.tooltip.item_drop.18=resonating every planck second.
item.tooltip.item_drop.19=Tends to catch fire or to create
item.tooltip.item_drop.20=small plasma arcs. Not edible.
item.tooltip.item_drop.21=Contains a regular singularity
item.tooltip.item_drop.22=in the center. Large enough to
